  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">water and hygiene support in Gaza city</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bayader &#x2013; Local implementing partner responsible for water trucking logistics, community mobilization, and field accompaniment. Bayader brings extensive local knowledge, established community networks, and proven capacity from previous interventions with Oxfam. Partnership agreement and due diligence are already completed and updated regularly, enabling rapid mobilization. Responsibilities include: managing water truck contracts, coordinating with communities, supervising distributions, collecting monitoring data, and ensuring quality standards. It should be noted that Oxfam runs a comprehensive partner and risk assessment pre engaging with the partner. Some additional measures that take place are: i) close monitoring of partner expenditure, (ii) involvement in major procurement and expenditure, and (iii) verification of partner expenditure before processing further partner transfers.</narrative>
  </description>
